  "scope": "Replace stale native callback Subtype rejection assertions with CPAN cross-target layout agreement while retaining invalid target and namespace refusals. Refresh only the five matching current-source inventory pins. Preserve the original source commit, reversible history, support claims, production gates, and all installed observations.",
